Improper Input Validation and Handling The service processes user-uploaded zip files, which are untrusted inputs. Without proper validation, this can lead to processing unexpected or malicious files., Resource Management Errors Handling file uploads and processing them without proper resource management can lead to issues such as resource exhaustion or denial of service.

